// Source text is preserved; concept groups are curated navigation aids.
window.WE_LIBRARY={"v":1,"source":{"filename":"PTE_WE_37题_总结与完整作文.docx","sha256":"384d9cdef23ca7c46ec352138f08dab93d380f343fa4e469abe93bd5627c08e9","note":"说明：题目保留原文。总结版使用立场句＋两个观点各3句；全文采用统一四段结构。对于原文件中以截图保存、无法逐字复核的内容，依据先前学习过的论点重新整理，不保证与截图原稿逐字一致。"},"essays":[{"id":"we-01","number":1,"title":"Formal Written Examinations","titleZh":"正式笔试","prompt":"Many education systems assess students' learning using formal written examinations. Those kinds of exams are a valid method. To what extent do you agree or disagree? Give examples with your own experience.","stanceZh":"同意正式笔试是有效的评估方式","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that formal written examinations are a fair and useful way to assess students.","points":[{"id":"1.1","title":"笔试对所有学生公平","sentences":["formal written examinations are fair and objective.","all students take the same test under the same conditions, so teachers can compare their results fairly.","when students take a written mathematics exam, teachers use the same rules to give marks."],"groups":["fairness"]},{"id":"1.2","title":"笔试帮助检查知识","sentences":["written examinations can test students’ knowledge.","students have to answer questions by themselves, which shows what they have learned.","in an English writing test, teachers can see whether students know how to use grammar correctly."],"groups":["knowledge-check"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about formal written examinations. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that formal written examinations are a fair and useful way to assess students.","First of all, from my point of view, formal written examinations are fair and objective. This means that all students take the same test under the same conditions, so teachers can compare their results fairly. For example, when students take a written mathematics exam, teachers use the same rules to give marks. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that written examinations can test students’ knowledge. To be more specific, students have to answer questions by themselves, which shows what they have learned. For instance, in an English writing test, teachers can see whether students know how to use grammar correctly. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that formal written examinations are a fair and useful way to assess students."]},{"id":"we-02","number":2,"title":"Mass Media","titleZh":"大众媒体","prompt":"The mass media, such as TV, radio and newspapers, have an influence on people, particularly on younger generations. It plays a pivotal role in shaping the opinions of people, especially teenagers and young people. To what extent do you agree with this? Please give examples.","stanceZh":"同意大众媒体影响年轻人的观点","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that mass media has a strong influence on young people’s opinions.","points":[{"id":"2.1","title":"媒体帮助年轻人获得信息","sentences":["mass media can help young people learn about important issues.","news reports allow students to understand problems in society and the world.","when students watch news about air pollution, they can learn why protecting the environment is important."],"groups":["knowledge"]},{"id":"2.2","title":"媒体也可能传播错误信息","sentences":["mass media can sometimes have negative effects on young people.","some online news may contain false information, which can influence how teenagers think.","when teenagers believe false stories shared on social media, they may form wrong opinions about other people."],"groups":["misinformation"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about mass media. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that mass media has a strong influence on young people’s opinions.","First of all, from my point of view, mass media can help young people learn about important issues. This means that news reports allow students to understand problems in society and the world. For example, when students watch news about air pollution, they can learn why protecting the environment is important. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that mass media can sometimes have negative effects on young people. To be more specific, some online news may contain false information, which can influence how teenagers think. For instance, when teenagers believe false stories shared on social media, they may form wrong opinions about other people. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that mass media has a strong influence on young people’s opinions."]},{"id":"we-03","number":3,"title":"Work and Personal Life","titleZh":"工作与私人生活","prompt":"Many people find that work leaves little time for people's personal life. How widespread do you think it is? How can we solve the problems caused by the shortage of time?","stanceZh":"工作占用私人时间的问题很普遍，需要改善","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that the lack of personal time is common, and employers should help workers solve this problem.","points":[{"id":"3.1","title":"工作时间过长很普遍","sentences":["many workers spend too much time at work and have little time for themselves.","heavy workloads and long working hours make it difficult for people to rest and see their families.","some office workers work late every day and cannot have dinner with their families."],"groups":["personal-time","family"]},{"id":"3.2","title":"公司应改善工作安排","sentences":["companies should take action to improve workers’ work-life balance.","flexible working hours can give workers more time to rest and spend with their families.","if workers can finish their tasks earlier, they can leave work on time and enjoy their personal lives."],"groups":["balance"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about work and personal life. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that the lack of personal time is common, and employers should help workers solve this problem.","First of all, from my point of view, many workers spend too much time at work and have little time for themselves. This means that heavy workloads and long working hours make it difficult for people to rest and see their families. For example, some office workers work late every day and cannot have dinner with their families. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that companies should take action to improve workers’ work-life balance. To be more specific, flexible working hours can give workers more time to rest and spend with their families. For instance, if workers can finish their tasks earlier, they can leave work on time and enjoy their personal lives. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that the lack of personal time is common, and employers should help workers solve this problem."]},{"id":"we-04","number":4,"title":"Parents’ Legal Responsibility","titleZh":"父母的法律责任","prompt":"Should parents be held legally responsible for the actions of their children? Support your opinion from your study, observations or experiences.","stanceZh":"父母应为孩子的某些不当行为承担责任","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that parents should take some legal responsibility for the actions of their children.","points":[{"id":"4.1","title":"父母应教育孩子遵守规则","sentences":["parents should teach their children to follow rules.","parents can help children understand what is right and wrong, so they are less likely to break rules.","if parents always teach children to follow traffic rules, they may help prevent accidents."],"groups":["rules"]},{"id":"4.2","title":"父母也应承担适当的后果","sentences":["parents should take responsibility when they fail to guide their children.","young children may not have enough money to pay for the damage they cause.","if a young child breaks something in a shop, the parents may need to pay for it."],"groups":["rules"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about parents’ legal responsibility. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that parents should take some legal responsibility for the actions of their children.","First of all, from my point of view, parents should teach their children to follow rules. This means that parents can help children understand what is right and wrong, so they are less likely to break rules. For example, if parents always teach children to follow traffic rules, they may help prevent accidents. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that parents should take responsibility when they fail to guide their children. To be more specific, young children may not have enough money to pay for the damage they cause. For instance, if a young child breaks something in a shop, the parents may need to pay for it. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that parents should take some legal responsibility for the actions of their children."]},{"id":"we-05","number":5,"title":"Late Assignments","titleZh":"作业迟交扣分","prompt":"Some universities deduct marks from students' work if it is given late. What is your opinion? What other actions do you recommend?","stanceZh":"同意合理扣分，也支持其他措施","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that universities should deduct some marks for late work and use other ways to encourage students.","points":[{"id":"5.1","title":"扣分有助于培养守时习惯","sentences":["deducting marks for late assignments can teach students to manage their time.","meeting deadlines is important in real life because delays may cause problems for other people.","if a company worker finishes a project late, it may cause serious problems for the company."],"groups":["time-management"]},{"id":"5.2","title":"也可以安排补充任务","sentences":["teachers can also give students extra tasks when they submit work late.","this can encourage students to take deadlines seriously and improve their study habits.","a student who submits homework late may need to complete an extra exercise to practise time management."],"groups":["time-management"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about late assignments. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that universities should deduct some marks for late work and use other ways to encourage students.","First of all, from my point of view, deducting marks for late assignments can teach students to manage their time. This means that meeting deadlines is important in real life because delays may cause problems for other people. For example, if a company worker finishes a project late, it may cause serious problems for the company. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that teachers can also give students extra tasks when they submit work late. To be more specific, this can encourage students to take deadlines seriously and improve their study habits. For instance, a student who submits homework late may need to complete an extra exercise to practise time management. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that universities should deduct some marks for late work and use other ways to encourage students."]},{"id":"we-06","number":6,"title":"Medical Technology and Life Expectancy","titleZh":"医疗技术与寿命","prompt":"medical technology is responsible for increasing the average life expectancy. Do you think it is a curse or a blessing?","stanceZh":"医疗技术延长寿命是一件好事","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that medical technology that helps people live longer is a blessing.","points":[{"id":"6.1","title":"人们可以陪伴家人更久","sentences":["medical technology gives people more time to enjoy life with their families.","modern treatments help people live longer, so they can spend more time with loved ones.","older people who receive good medical care can stay with their children for more years."],"groups":["family"]},{"id":"6.2","title":"医疗技术提高生活质量","sentences":["medical technology can improve people’s quality of life.","modern treatments help doctors find diseases early, so patients can receive care sooner.","older people can receive better treatment and stay healthy enough to enjoy their daily lives."],"groups":["health"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about medical technology and life expectancy. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that medical technology that helps people live longer is a blessing.","First of all, from my point of view, medical technology gives people more time to enjoy life with their families. This means that modern treatments help people live longer, so they can spend more time with loved ones. For example, older people who receive good medical care can stay with their children for more years. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that medical technology can improve people’s quality of life. To be more specific, modern treatments help doctors find diseases early, so patients can receive care sooner. For instance, older people can receive better treatment and stay healthy enough to enjoy their daily lives. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that medical technology that helps people live longer is a blessing."]},{"id":"we-07","number":7,"title":"Building Design","titleZh":"建筑设计","prompt":"Do you think the design of buildings affects, either positively or negatively, where people live and work?","stanceZh":"建筑设计会积极影响生活和工作","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that good building design can have positive effects on people’s lives and work.","points":[{"id":"7.1","title":"设计提高工作效率","sentences":["good building design can improve work efficiency.","a quiet and bright office helps workers focus on their tasks and make fewer mistakes.","when office workers have enough light and a quiet place to work, they can finish their tasks faster."],"groups":["efficiency"]},{"id":"7.2","title":"设计改善身体健康","sentences":["good building design can improve people’s health.","houses with large windows can get more sunlight and fresh air, which makes people feel better.","when people live in a house with good air and enough space, they can exercise at home and enjoy a healthier life."],"groups":["health"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about building design. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that good building design can have positive effects on people’s lives and work.","First of all, from my point of view, good building design can improve work efficiency. This means that a quiet and bright office helps workers focus on their tasks and make fewer mistakes. For example, when office workers have enough light and a quiet place to work, they can finish their tasks faster. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that good building design can improve people’s health. To be more specific, houses with large windows can get more sunlight and fresh air, which makes people feel better. For instance, when people live in a house with good air and enough space, they can exercise at home and enjoy a healthier life. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that good building design can have positive effects on people’s lives and work."]},{"id":"we-08","number":8,"title":"Long Working Hours","titleZh":"工作时间过长","prompt":"Nowadays, people who devote too much time to their job leave very little time for their personal and private life. How widespread is the problem? What problem will this shortage of time cause?","stanceZh":"工作侵占私人生活的问题普遍且有危害","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that working too many hours is a common problem that can harm people’s health and family life.","points":[{"id":"8.1","title":"工作时间过长影响健康","sentences":["the lack of personal time can harm people’s health.","people who work for long hours often feel tired and stressed because they cannot get enough rest.","some workers have to work late every night, so they cannot get enough sleep and may feel tired the next day."],"groups":["health","mental-health"]},{"id":"8.2","title":"工作影响家庭关系","sentences":["long working hours can also damage family relationships.","people may have little time to communicate with their families when they spend most of the day at work.","some parents cannot have dinner with their children because they regularly return home late."],"groups":["personal-time","family"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about long working hours. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that working too many hours is a common problem that can harm people’s health and family life.","First of all, from my point of view, the lack of personal time can harm people’s health. This means that people who work for long hours often feel tired and stressed because they cannot get enough rest. For example, some workers have to work late every night, so they cannot get enough sleep and may feel tired the next day. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that long working hours can also damage family relationships. To be more specific, people may have little time to communicate with their families when they spend most of the day at work. For instance, some parents cannot have dinner with their children because they regularly return home late. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that working too many hours is a common problem that can harm people’s health and family life."]},{"id":"we-09","number":9,"title":"Global Issue","titleZh":"全球重大问题","prompt":"The world's governments and international organizations confront a multitude of global problems. Which do you think is the most pressing problem for the inhabitants of our planet and give the solution?","stanceZh":"气候变化是最紧迫的问题，需要政府行动","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that climate change is one of the most pressing global problems, and governments should take action.","points":[{"id":"9.1","title":"气候变化威胁人们生活","sentences":["climate change can cause serious problems for people’s lives.","rising temperatures and sea levels can lead to floods and damage homes and farmland.","many people living near the sea may need to leave their homes because of serious flooding."],"groups":["climate-risk"]},{"id":"9.2","title":"政府能够采取解决措施","sentences":["governments can take effective action to fight climate change.","they can make rules to reduce pollution and support the use of clean energy.","governments can help companies use solar and wind power instead of fuels that cause pollution."],"groups":["environment-policy"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about global issue. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that climate change is one of the most pressing global problems, and governments should take action.","First of all, from my point of view, climate change can cause serious problems for people’s lives. This means that rising temperatures and sea levels can lead to floods and damage homes and farmland. For example, many people living near the sea may need to leave their homes because of serious flooding. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that governments can take effective action to fight climate change. To be more specific, they can make rules to reduce pollution and support the use of clean energy. For instance, governments can help companies use solar and wind power instead of fuels that cause pollution. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that climate change is one of the most pressing global problems, and governments should take action."]},{"id":"we-10","number":10,"title":"Old Theatre Works","titleZh":"古老戏剧作品","prompt":"What are the problems and the benefits for high school students of studying plays and other works for theatre that were written centuries ago? Use your own experience to discuss it.","stanceZh":"学习古老戏剧有好处也有困难","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that studying old theatre works has both benefits and problems for students.","points":[{"id":"10.1","title":"古老语言难以理解","sentences":["old plays can be challenging for students to understand.","these plays often use old language and unfamiliar words, making it difficult for students to follow the story.","when I studied an old play at school, I had to ask my teacher to explain many difficult words."],"groups":["language"]},{"id":"10.2","title":"古老戏剧帮助了解历史","sentences":["studying old plays can help students learn about history and culture.","old plays show how people lived and what they believed in the past.","when students read old plays about family life, they can learn about traditional family values and the roles of parents and children."],"groups":["culture"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about old theatre works. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that studying old theatre works has both benefits and problems for students.","First of all, from my point of view, old plays can be challenging for students to understand. This means that these plays often use old language and unfamiliar words, making it difficult for students to follow the story. For example, when I studied an old play at school, I had to ask my teacher to explain many difficult words. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that studying old plays can help students learn about history and culture. To be more specific, old plays show how people lived and what they believed in the past. For instance, when students read old plays about family life, they can learn about traditional family values and the roles of parents and children. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that studying old theatre works has both benefits and problems for students."]},{"id":"we-11","number":11,"title":"Digital Materials vs Textbooks","titleZh":"数字资料与纸质教材","prompt":"With the increase of digital media available online, the role of the library has become obsolete. Universities should only procure new digital media rather than constantly update textbooks. Discuss both the advantages and disadvantages of this position and give your own point of view.","stanceZh":"数字资料有优势也有缺点","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that using digital materials at universities has both advantages and disadvantages.","points":[{"id":"11.1","title":"数字资料更新更快","sentences":["digital materials can provide students with new information more quickly.","digital textbooks are easier to update than paper books, so students can learn the latest knowledge.","when students study computer science, they can read updated digital textbooks to learn about new technology."],"groups":["knowledge"]},{"id":"11.2","title":"长时间看屏幕影响健康","sentences":["using digital materials for too long can harm students’ health.","students often spend many hours looking at screens, so their eyes may become tired.","when students read digital textbooks on computers for several hours, they may have eye problems and headaches."],"groups":["health","screen-risk"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about digital materials vs textbooks. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that using digital materials at universities has both advantages and disadvantages.","First of all, from my point of view, digital materials can provide students with new information more quickly. This means that digital textbooks are easier to update than paper books, so students can learn the latest knowledge. For example, when students study computer science, they can read updated digital textbooks to learn about new technology. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that using digital materials for too long can harm students’ health. To be more specific, students often spend many hours looking at screens, so their eyes may become tired. For instance, when students read digital textbooks on computers for several hours, they may have eye problems and headaches. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that using digital materials at universities has both advantages and disadvantages."]},{"id":"we-12","number":12,"title":"Working While Studying","titleZh":"边学习边工作","prompt":"Effective study requires time, comfort and peace. It is impossible to combine a student's learning with employment because one may distract the other. To what extent do you think the statements are realistic? Give your opinion with examples.","stanceZh":"学生可以合理兼顾学习和兼职","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that students can combine studying with part-time work if they manage their time well.","points":[{"id":"12.1","title":"合理安排时间可以兼顾两者","sentences":["students can balance their studies and jobs by planning their time carefully.","students can choose part-time jobs with short working hours, so they still have enough time to study.","students can work on weekends and study during the week, which helps them finish their schoolwork on time."],"groups":["balance","time-management"]},{"id":"12.2","title":"兼职能获得实际能力","sentences":["part-time jobs can help students develop useful skills without stopping their studies.","students can learn how to work with others and solve problems through practice.","when students work part-time in a shop during school holidays, they can learn how to talk to customers."],"groups":["practice"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about working while studying. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that students can combine studying with part-time work if they manage their time well.","First of all, from my point of view, students can balance their studies and jobs by planning their time carefully. This means that students can choose part-time jobs with short working hours, so they still have enough time to study. For example, students can work on weekends and study during the week, which helps them finish their schoolwork on time. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that part-time jobs can help students develop useful skills without stopping their studies. To be more specific, students can learn how to work with others and solve problems through practice. For instance, when students work part-time in a shop during school holidays, they can learn how to talk to customers. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that students can combine studying with part-time work if they manage their time well."]},{"id":"we-13","number":13,"title":"Tourism in Developing Countries","titleZh":"发展中国家旅游业","prompt":"For a less developed country, the disadvantages of tourism are as great as the advantages. Please discuss this statement, and explain your opinion.","stanceZh":"旅游业有经济好处也有环境问题","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that tourism in less developed countries has both advantages and disadvantages.","points":[{"id":"13.1","title":"旅游业增加工作机会","sentences":["tourism can provide more job opportunities for local people.","tourists spend money in hotels, restaurants and shops, so local businesses need more workers.","when more tourists visit a small town, local hotels and restaurants may employ more people."],"groups":["jobs","tourism"]},{"id":"13.2","title":"游客过多会破坏环境","sentences":["tourism can cause serious environmental problems.","large numbers of tourists may produce more rubbish and damage natural places.","when many visitors travel to beaches, they may leave plastic bottles and other waste, which can pollute the sea."],"groups":["pollution"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about tourism in developing countries. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that tourism in less developed countries has both advantages and disadvantages.","First of all, from my point of view, tourism can provide more job opportunities for local people. This means that tourists spend money in hotels, restaurants and shops, so local businesses need more workers. For example, when more tourists visit a small town, local hotels and restaurants may employ more people. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that tourism can cause serious environmental problems. To be more specific, large numbers of tourists may produce more rubbish and damage natural places. For instance, when many visitors travel to beaches, they may leave plastic bottles and other waste, which can pollute the sea. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that tourism in less developed countries has both advantages and disadvantages."]},{"id":"we-14","number":14,"title":"Television","titleZh":"电视的作用","prompt":"Television serves many useful functions. It helps people to relax. We can learn from television, and it can also be seen as a companion for the lonely. To what extent do you agree with this? Explain why with your own experience.","stanceZh":"电视有助于学习，也能陪伴孤独者","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that television can help people learn, relax and feel less lonely.","points":[{"id":"14.1","title":"电视帮助学习知识","sentences":["television can help people learn useful knowledge.","news and educational programs can help people understand the world and learn new things.","when I watch nature documentaries on TV, I can learn how animals live and how to protect the environment."],"groups":["knowledge"]},{"id":"14.2","title":"电视陪伴独居的人","sentences":["television can be a good companion for lonely people.","people who live alone can watch TV and hear other people’s voices, which may help them feel less lonely.","an older person who lives alone can watch the news every morning and learn about what is happening in the world."],"groups":["mental-health"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about television. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that television can help people learn, relax and feel less lonely.","First of all, from my point of view, television can help people learn useful knowledge. This means that news and educational programs can help people understand the world and learn new things. For example, when I watch nature documentaries on TV, I can learn how animals live and how to protect the environment. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that television can be a good companion for lonely people. To be more specific, people who live alone can watch TV and hear other people’s voices, which may help them feel less lonely. For instance, an older person who lives alone can watch the news every morning and learn about what is happening in the world. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that television can help people learn, relax and feel less lonely."]},{"id":"we-15","number":15,"title":"Famous People and Privacy","titleZh":"名人与隐私权","prompt":"People who are famous entertainers or sportspeople should give up the right to privacy as this is the price of fame. To what extent do you agree/disagree with this point of view? Give your opinion with your experiences.","stanceZh":"名人不应该放弃隐私权","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that famous people should not give up their right to privacy.","points":[{"id":"15.1","title":"隐私是每个人的基本权利","sentences":["privacy is a basic right for everyone, including famous people.","famous people should have the right to keep their personal lives private and stay safe.","if someone shares the home address of a famous singer online, strangers may come to their home and cause problems."],"groups":["privacy"]},{"id":"15.2","title":"失去隐私会影响心理健康","sentences":["losing privacy can have negative effects on people’s mental health.","famous people may feel stressed when others watch and discuss their personal lives every day.","some famous actors cannot spend time with their families in public without being followed or photographed, which may make them feel unhappy and stressed."],"groups":["mental-health"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about famous people and privacy. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that famous people should not give up their right to privacy.","First of all, from my point of view, privacy is a basic right for everyone, including famous people. This means that famous people should have the right to keep their personal lives private and stay safe. For example, if someone shares the home address of a famous singer online, strangers may come to their home and cause problems. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that losing privacy can have negative effects on people’s mental health. To be more specific, famous people may feel stressed when others watch and discuss their personal lives every day. For instance, some famous actors cannot spend time with their families in public without being followed or photographed, which may make them feel unhappy and stressed. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that famous people should not give up their right to privacy."]},{"id":"we-16","number":16,"title":"Maximum Wage","titleZh":"最高工资上限","prompt":"Many people say there should be a maximum wage for high-paying jobs as some people are paid too much. Do you support that？Can you give your point of view or your own experience？","stanceZh":"不同意为高薪工作设置工资上限","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that governments should not set a maximum wage for high-paying jobs.","points":[{"id":"16.1","title":"限制工资降低工作动力","sentences":["setting a maximum wage can reduce people’s motivation to work hard and develop new ideas.","some workers may not want to spend extra time improving their skills if they cannot earn more money.","some programmers may be less willing to spend time developing new software if their salaries cannot increase."],"groups":["motivation"]},{"id":"16.2","title":"限制工资对努力工作的人不公平","sentences":["setting a maximum wage can be unfair to hard-working people.","some workers have difficult jobs and work long hours, so they should receive more money for their efforts.","doctors often work overtime to save patients, and they deserve higher pay for their hard work."],"groups":["fairness"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about maximum wage. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that governments should not set a maximum wage for high-paying jobs.","First of all, from my point of view, setting a maximum wage can reduce people’s motivation to work hard and develop new ideas. This means that some workers may not want to spend extra time improving their skills if they cannot earn more money. For example, some programmers may be less willing to spend time developing new software if their salaries cannot increase. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that setting a maximum wage can be unfair to hard-working people. To be more specific, some workers have difficult jobs and work long hours, so they should receive more money for their efforts. For instance, doctors often work overtime to save patients, and they deserve higher pay for their hard work. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that governments should not set a maximum wage for high-paying jobs."]},{"id":"we-17","number":17,"title":"Travel and Education","titleZh":"旅行与教育","prompt":"Some believe the value of travel is highly overrated. 'One brilliant scholar never leaves the home bases.' To what extent do you agree that travel is not a necessary component of a quality education?","stanceZh":"旅行是高质量教育的重要组成部分","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that travel is a necessary part of a quality education.","points":[{"id":"17.1","title":"旅行帮助理解历史与文化","sentences":["travel can help students understand history and culture better.","students can learn more by visiting real places instead of only reading books.","when students travel to Rome and visit old buildings, they can learn about history and understand how people lived in the past."],"groups":["culture"]},{"id":"17.2","title":"旅行提高交流能力","sentences":["travel can improve students’ communication skills.","students can meet people from different countries and learn how to communicate with them.","when students travel to another country, they may need to speak English to ask for directions or buy food, which can help them improve their language skills."],"groups":["practice"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about travel and education. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that travel is a necessary part of a quality education.","First of all, from my point of view, travel can help students understand history and culture better. This means that students can learn more by visiting real places instead of only reading books. For example, when students travel to Rome and visit old buildings, they can learn about history and understand how people lived in the past. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that travel can improve students’ communication skills. To be more specific, students can meet people from different countries and learn how to communicate with them. For instance, when students travel to another country, they may need to speak English to ask for directions or buy food, which can help them improve their language skills. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that travel is a necessary part of a quality education."]},{"id":"we-18","number":18,"title":"Public Transport vs Roads","titleZh":"公共交通与道路","prompt":"With cities expanding, governments should look forward to creating better networks of public transport available for everyone rather than building more roads for vehicle owning population. To what extent do you agree or disagree?","stanceZh":"应优先发展公共交通","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that governments should develop better public transport rather than build more roads for cars.","points":[{"id":"18.1","title":"公共交通帮助没有车的人","sentences":["public transport can help people who cannot afford a car.","buses and trains allow people to travel to work or school without buying their own vehicles.","people who cannot afford a car can still travel to work or school by bus or train."],"groups":["access","convenience"]},{"id":"18.2","title":"公共交通减少污染","sentences":["public transport is more environmentally friendly than travelling by car.","when more people use buses and trains, there may be fewer cars on the roads and less air pollution.","if people choose buses instead of private cars every day, their city may have cleaner air."],"groups":["pollution"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about public transport vs roads. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that governments should develop better public transport rather than build more roads for cars.","First of all, from my point of view, public transport can help people who cannot afford a car. This means that buses and trains allow people to travel to work or school without buying their own vehicles. For example, people who cannot afford a car can still travel to work or school by bus or train. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that public transport is more environmentally friendly than travelling by car. To be more specific, when more people use buses and trains, there may be fewer cars on the roads and less air pollution. For instance, if people choose buses instead of private cars every day, their city may have cleaner air. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that governments should develop better public transport rather than build more roads for cars."]},{"id":"we-19","number":19,"title":"Climate Change Responsibility","titleZh":"应对气候变化的责任","prompt":"Climate change is a concerning global issue. Who has the main responsibility to take action to solve this problem, governments, large companies, or individuals?","stanceZh":"政府应承担主要责任","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that governments should take the main responsibility for solving climate change.","points":[{"id":"19.1","title":"政府能提供资金","sentences":["governments have enough resources to support action against climate change.","they can invest money in clean energy and help companies use new technology.","governments can provide financial support to build large solar power stations and reduce pollution."],"groups":["environment-policy"]},{"id":"19.2","title":"政府能制定环保法规","sentences":["governments can make rules to protect the environment.","they can require large companies to reduce pollution and use cleaner technology.","governments can set limits on pollution from factories and punish businesses that break these rules."],"groups":["environment-policy","pollution"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about climate change responsibility. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that governments should take the main responsibility for solving climate change.","First of all, from my point of view, governments have enough resources to support action against climate change. This means that they can invest money in clean energy and help companies use new technology. For example, governments can provide financial support to build large solar power stations and reduce pollution. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that governments can make rules to protect the environment. To be more specific, they can require large companies to reduce pollution and use cleaner technology. For instance, governments can set limits on pollution from factories and punish businesses that break these rules. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that governments should take the main responsibility for solving climate change."]},{"id":"we-20","number":20,"title":"Information Revolution","titleZh":"信息革命","prompt":"The information revolution brought about by modern mass communications has both positive and negative consequences for individuals and society. To what extent do you agree with this statement? Give the reason with your own experience.","stanceZh":"信息革命既有好处又有坏处","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that the information revolution has both positive and negative effects on society.","points":[{"id":"20.1","title":"信息获取更加方便","sentences":["modern communication technology makes it easier for people to get information.","people can learn new things and communicate with others quickly through the internet.","students can use online lessons to find answers to school questions without visiting a library."],"groups":["knowledge"]},{"id":"20.2","title":"错误信息传播更快","sentences":["the information revolution can also spread false information.","some people share stories online without checking whether the information is correct.","when teenagers see false news on social media, they may believe it and share it with their friends."],"groups":["misinformation"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about information revolution. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that the information revolution has both positive and negative effects on society.","First of all, from my point of view, modern communication technology makes it easier for people to get information. This means that people can learn new things and communicate with others quickly through the internet. For example, students can use online lessons to find answers to school questions without visiting a library. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that the information revolution can also spread false information. To be more specific, some people share stories online without checking whether the information is correct. For instance, when teenagers see false news on social media, they may believe it and share it with their friends. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that the information revolution has both positive and negative effects on society."]},{"id":"we-21","number":21,"title":"Shopping Malls vs Local Shops","titleZh":"商场与小商店","prompt":"In many towns and cities large shopping malls are replacing small local shops. Some people say that this is a positive development. To what extent do you agree?","stanceZh":"大型商场取代小店有利有弊","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that large shopping malls replacing small shops has both benefits and drawbacks.","points":[{"id":"21.1","title":"商场购物更加方便","sentences":["large shopping malls can make shopping more convenient.","people can buy many kinds of products in one place and save time.","families can buy food, clothes and daily products in the same shopping mall instead of visiting several shops."],"groups":["convenience"]},{"id":"21.2","title":"小商店可能失去顾客","sentences":["large shopping malls can create problems for small local shops.","small businesses may lose customers because many people prefer shopping in large malls.","when a new shopping mall opens, a small shop nearby may sell fewer products and earn less money."],"groups":["income"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about shopping malls vs local shops. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that large shopping malls replacing small shops has both benefits and drawbacks.","First of all, from my point of view, large shopping malls can make shopping more convenient. This means that people can buy many kinds of products in one place and save time. For example, families can buy food, clothes and daily products in the same shopping mall instead of visiting several shops. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that large shopping malls can create problems for small local shops. To be more specific, small businesses may lose customers because many people prefer shopping in large malls. For instance, when a new shopping mall opens, a small shop nearby may sell fewer products and earn less money. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that large shopping malls replacing small shops has both benefits and drawbacks."]},{"id":"we-22","number":22,"title":"Work-Life Balance","titleZh":"工作生活平衡","prompt":"Nowadays, it is increasingly more difficult to maintain the right balance between work and the other aspects of one's life, such as leisure pursuits with family members. How important do you think this balance is and what are the reasons why some people think that this is hard to achieve？","stanceZh":"工作生活平衡非常重要但很难实现","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that work-life balance is important, but many workers find it difficult to achieve.","points":[{"id":"22.1","title":"平衡有助于身心健康","sentences":["a good work-life balance can improve people’s health.","people need enough time to rest and spend with their families, so they feel less stressed.","workers who finish work on time can exercise and have dinner with their families every day."],"groups":["health","mental-health"]},{"id":"22.2","title":"工作压力使平衡困难","sentences":["heavy workloads make work-life balance difficult for many people.","some companies expect workers to work long hours, leaving little time for their personal lives.","some office workers have to answer work messages at night, so they cannot relax after work."],"groups":["personal-time"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about work-life balance. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that work-life balance is important, but many workers find it difficult to achieve.","First of all, from my point of view, a good work-life balance can improve people’s health. This means that people need enough time to rest and spend with their families, so they feel less stressed. For example, workers who finish work on time can exercise and have dinner with their families every day. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that heavy workloads make work-life balance difficult for many people. To be more specific, some companies expect workers to work long hours, leaving little time for their personal lives. For instance, some office workers have to answer work messages at night, so they cannot relax after work. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that work-life balance is important, but many workers find it difficult to achieve."]},{"id":"we-23","number":23,"title":"Workers in Decision-Making","titleZh":"员工参与决策","prompt":"In some companies, employers involve workers in the decision-making process about products and services. What are the advantages and disadvantages of such a policy?","stanceZh":"员工参与决策既有优势又有劣势","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that involving workers in company decisions has both advantages and disadvantages.","points":[{"id":"23.1","title":"员工能提供实用建议","sentences":["workers can provide useful ideas to improve products and services.","workers understand daily problems at work and may know what customers need.","shop workers who talk with customers every day can suggest ways to improve customer service."],"groups":["frontline"]},{"id":"23.2","title":"多人决策需要更多时间","sentences":["involving many workers can make decisions slower.","different workers may have different opinions, so managers need more time to reach an agreement.","when a company asks every worker to discuss a small change, it may take several days to make a decision."],"groups":["efficiency"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about workers in decision-making. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that involving workers in company decisions has both advantages and disadvantages.","First of all, from my point of view, workers can provide useful ideas to improve products and services. This means that workers understand daily problems at work and may know what customers need. For example, shop workers who talk with customers every day can suggest ways to improve customer service. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that involving many workers can make decisions slower. To be more specific, different workers may have different opinions, so managers need more time to reach an agreement. For instance, when a company asks every worker to discuss a small change, it may take several days to make a decision. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that involving workers in company decisions has both advantages and disadvantages."]},{"id":"we-24","number":24,"title":"Experiential Learning","titleZh":"实践学习","prompt":"Some people point that experiential learning (i.e. learning by doing) can work well in formal education. However, others think a traditional form of teaching is the best. Do you think experiential learning can work well in high schools or colleges?","stanceZh":"实践学习能有效帮助学生","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that experiential learning can be a useful part of formal education.","points":[{"id":"24.1","title":"实践帮助理解知识","sentences":["learning by doing can help students understand knowledge better.","students can use what they learn in class to solve real problems.","when students build a simple computer program by themselves, they can understand coding better."],"groups":["practice"]},{"id":"24.2","title":"实践有助于培养技能","sentences":["experiential learning helps students develop useful skills.","students learn how to work with other people and solve problems through practice.","when students work on group projects, they learn how to communicate and finish tasks together."],"groups":["practice"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about experiential learning. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that experiential learning can be a useful part of formal education.","First of all, from my point of view, learning by doing can help students understand knowledge better. This means that students can use what they learn in class to solve real problems. For example, when students build a simple computer program by themselves, they can understand coding better. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that experiential learning helps students develop useful skills. To be more specific, students learn how to work with other people and solve problems through practice. For instance, when students work on group projects, they learn how to communicate and finish tasks together. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that experiential learning can be a useful part of formal education."]},{"id":"we-25","number":25,"title":"Age Limits","titleZh":"年龄限制","prompt":"Age restrictions are placed on many activities. It is believed that people should not do things until they reach the right ages, such as getting married, driving, voting, buying certain products, and doing particular things. Give an example, state which minimum age you think it should be and share your own experience.","stanceZh":"某些活动应设置最低年龄","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that some activities should have minimum age limits to protect young people.","points":[{"id":"25.1","title":"年龄限制保护未成年人","sentences":["age limits can protect children from harmful activities.","young children may not understand the risks of social media and may spend too much time watching videos.","children under the age of twelve may watch harmful videos online if social media has no age limits."],"groups":["screen-risk"]},{"id":"25.2","title":"年龄限制帮助作出安全决定","sentences":["age limits can help ensure that people are ready for important responsibilities.","some activities, such as driving, require good judgement and an understanding of safety rules.","people who are eighteen may be more prepared to follow traffic rules and drive safely than younger children."],"groups":["rules"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about age limits. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that some activities should have minimum age limits to protect young people.","First of all, from my point of view, age limits can protect children from harmful activities. This means that young children may not understand the risks of social media and may spend too much time watching videos. For example, children under the age of twelve may watch harmful videos online if social media has no age limits. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that age limits can help ensure that people are ready for important responsibilities. To be more specific, some activities, such as driving, require good judgement and an understanding of safety rules. For instance, people who are eighteen may be more prepared to follow traffic rules and drive safely than younger children. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that some activities should have minimum age limits to protect young people."]},{"id":"we-26","number":26,"title":"Life Experience vs Books","titleZh":"生活经验与书本","prompt":"Some people argue that experience is the best teacher, saying life experiences teach people more effectively than books or formal education can. How far do you agree with this statement? Give your reason or provide an example from your own experience.","stanceZh":"生活经历对学习同样重要","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that life experience is an important teacher because it gives people practical knowledge.","points":[{"id":"26.1","title":"经历帮助解决实际问题","sentences":["life experience helps people learn how to solve real problems.","people can practise what they have learned instead of only reading about it in books.","when students work part-time in a shop, they can learn how to communicate with customers."],"groups":["practice"]},{"id":"26.2","title":"经历教会独立思考","sentences":["life experience can help people become more independent.","people often need to make decisions by themselves when they face new situations.","when students travel alone, they learn how to plan their time and deal with unexpected problems."],"groups":["independence"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about life experience vs books. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that life experience is an important teacher because it gives people practical knowledge.","First of all, from my point of view, life experience helps people learn how to solve real problems. This means that people can practise what they have learned instead of only reading about it in books. For example, when students work part-time in a shop, they can learn how to communicate with customers. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that life experience can help people become more independent. To be more specific, people often need to make decisions by themselves when they face new situations. For instance, when students travel alone, they learn how to plan their time and deal with unexpected problems. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that life experience is an important teacher because it gives people practical knowledge."]},{"id":"we-27","number":27,"title":"Studying Climate Change","titleZh":"研究气候变化","prompt":"Imagine you have been assigned on the study of climate change. Which area of climate change will you focus on and why? Use examples.","stanceZh":"重点研究海平面上升","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that I would focus on rising sea levels because they can seriously affect people’s lives.","points":[{"id":"27.1","title":"海平面上升威胁居民","sentences":["rising sea levels can cause serious problems for people living near the coast.","higher sea levels can lead to flooding and damage homes and roads in coastal areas.","families living near the sea may need to move to safer places after repeated floods."],"groups":["climate-risk"]},{"id":"27.2","title":"研究能够帮助寻找措施","sentences":["studying rising sea levels can help people find ways to protect coastal communities.","governments can use research to improve flood protection and prepare for future problems.","scientists can study which coastal towns face the greatest risk, so governments can build better flood barriers."],"groups":["research"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about studying climate change. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that I would focus on rising sea levels because they can seriously affect people’s lives.","First of all, from my point of view, rising sea levels can cause serious problems for people living near the coast. This means that higher sea levels can lead to flooding and damage homes and roads in coastal areas. For example, families living near the sea may need to move to safer places after repeated floods. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that studying rising sea levels can help people find ways to protect coastal communities. To be more specific, governments can use research to improve flood protection and prepare for future problems. For instance, scientists can study which coastal towns face the greatest risk, so governments can build better flood barriers. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that I would focus on rising sea levels because they can seriously affect people’s lives."]},{"id":"we-28","number":28,"title":"Marketing and Company Reputation","titleZh":"品牌信誉与促销","prompt":"Should marketing in companies which produce consumer goods, like food and clothing, place emphasis on the reputation of the company or short-term strategies like discounts and special offers? Why?","stanceZh":"营销应优先重视公司信誉","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that companies should focus more on their reputation than on short-term discounts.","points":[{"id":"28.1","title":"良好信誉赢得信任","sentences":["a good company reputation can help businesses gain customers’ trust.","people are more likely to buy products from brands they believe are reliable.","when a food company sells safe and good-quality products, customers may buy from it again and recommend it to friends."],"groups":["trust"]},{"id":"28.2","title":"长期打折降低利润","sentences":["offering too many discounts can reduce company profits.","when products are often sold at lower prices, businesses may earn less money.","if a clothing company offers large discounts every week, it may not earn enough money to improve its products."],"groups":["income"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about marketing and company reputation. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that companies should focus more on their reputation than on short-term discounts.","First of all, from my point of view, a good company reputation can help businesses gain customers’ trust. This means that people are more likely to buy products from brands they believe are reliable. For example, when a food company sells safe and good-quality products, customers may buy from it again and recommend it to friends. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that offering too many discounts can reduce company profits. To be more specific, when products are often sold at lower prices, businesses may earn less money. For instance, if a clothing company offers large discounts every week, it may not earn enough money to improve its products. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that companies should focus more on their reputation than on short-term discounts."]},{"id":"we-29","number":29,"title":"Law and Human Behaviour","titleZh":"法律与行为","prompt":"Some people think human behavior can be changed by laws, while others think laws have little effect. What is your opinion?","stanceZh":"法律能够改变人们的行为","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that laws can have a strong influence on human behaviour.","points":[{"id":"29.1","title":"法律减少有害行为","sentences":["laws can prevent people from doing things that harm others.","when people know they may receive a fine for breaking rules, they are more likely to follow them.","in places where smoking is banned in restaurants, customers must smoke outside to avoid fines."],"groups":["rules"]},{"id":"29.2","title":"法律促进环境保护","sentences":["laws can encourage companies to protect the environment.","governments can introduce rules that require factories to reduce pollution.","when factories are required to use cleaner technology, they may produce less pollution and protect local communities."],"groups":["environment-policy","pollution"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about law and human behaviour. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that laws can have a strong influence on human behaviour.","First of all, from my point of view, laws can prevent people from doing things that harm others. This means that when people know they may receive a fine for breaking rules, they are more likely to follow them. For example, in places where smoking is banned in restaurants, customers must smoke outside to avoid fines. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that laws can encourage companies to protect the environment. To be more specific, governments can introduce rules that require factories to reduce pollution. For instance, when factories are required to use cleaner technology, they may produce less pollution and protect local communities. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that laws can have a strong influence on human behaviour."]},{"id":"we-30","number":30,"title":"New Inventions: AI Chat Bots","titleZh":"新发明与人工智能","prompt":"In our technological world, the number of new inventions has been evolving daily. Please describe a new invention and determine whether it has a beneficial or detrimental impact on society.","stanceZh":"AI聊天工具给社会带来好处","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that AI chat bots are useful new inventions that can benefit society.","points":[{"id":"30.1","title":"AI帮助学生学习","sentences":["AI chat bots can help students learn new knowledge.","students can ask questions and get explanations when they do not understand their lessons.","when students have problems with computer programming, they can use AI chat bots to understand how to fix mistakes."],"groups":["knowledge"]},{"id":"30.2","title":"AI提高工作效率","sentences":["AI chat bots can improve people’s work efficiency.","they can help workers finish simple tasks faster and save time.","office workers can use AI chat bots to write emails and make work plans, allowing them to focus on other tasks."],"groups":["efficiency"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about new inventions: ai chat bots. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that AI chat bots are useful new inventions that can benefit society.","First of all, from my point of view, AI chat bots can help students learn new knowledge. This means that students can ask questions and get explanations when they do not understand their lessons. For example, when students have problems with computer programming, they can use AI chat bots to understand how to fix mistakes. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that AI chat bots can improve people’s work efficiency. To be more specific, they can help workers finish simple tasks faster and save time. For instance, office workers can use AI chat bots to write emails and make work plans, allowing them to focus on other tasks. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that AI chat bots are useful new inventions that can benefit society."]},{"id":"we-31","number":31,"title":"Fewer Work Hours in the Future","titleZh":"未来工时减少","prompt":"\"In the future, people will work fewer hours at their jobs than they do now.\" How far do you agree with the statement? Please support your opinion with your own experience.","stanceZh":"未来人们的工作时间会减少","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that people will probably work fewer hours in the future.","points":[{"id":"31.1","title":"技术帮助更快完成任务","sentences":["AI and automation can help people finish their work faster.","machines can complete some simple tasks, so workers may need fewer hours to finish the same amount of work.","office workers can use AI to prepare reports more quickly instead of spending several hours doing them by hand."],"groups":["efficiency"]},{"id":"31.2","title":"企业越来越重视平衡","sentences":["more companies may support shorter working hours to improve work-life balance.","workers who get more time to rest may feel less stressed and work more efficiently.","some companies may allow employees to work four days a week so they have more time with their families."],"groups":["balance","family"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about fewer work hours in the future. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that people will probably work fewer hours in the future.","First of all, from my point of view, AI and automation can help people finish their work faster. This means that machines can complete some simple tasks, so workers may need fewer hours to finish the same amount of work. For example, office workers can use AI to prepare reports more quickly instead of spending several hours doing them by hand. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that more companies may support shorter working hours to improve work-life balance. To be more specific, workers who get more time to rest may feel less stressed and work more efficiently. For instance, some companies may allow employees to work four days a week so they have more time with their families. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that people will probably work fewer hours in the future."]},{"id":"we-32","number":32,"title":"Shorter Working Weeks and Unemployment","titleZh":"缩短工作周与失业","prompt":"In many countries unemployment among young people is a serious problem. One suggested solution is to shorten the working week. What do you think are the advantages and disadvantages? Do you think this policy should apply to just young workers or all age groups？","stanceZh":"缩短工作周有利有弊，应适用于各年龄","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that shorter working weeks have both advantages and disadvantages and should apply to workers of all ages.","points":[{"id":"32.1","title":"缩短工时可能增加工作机会","sentences":["shorter working weeks can create more job opportunities for young people.","when workers spend fewer days at work, companies may need more people to finish daily tasks.","a company that reduces working days may need to find more young people to help finish its work."],"groups":["jobs"]},{"id":"32.2","title":"按小时计薪者可能收入减少","sentences":["shorter working weeks can reduce the income of some workers.","people who are paid by the hour may earn less money when they work fewer hours.","some workers may find it difficult to pay for rent and food if their working hours are reduced."],"groups":["income"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about shorter working weeks and unemployment. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that shorter working weeks have both advantages and disadvantages and should apply to workers of all ages.","First of all, from my point of view, shorter working weeks can create more job opportunities for young people. This means that when workers spend fewer days at work, companies may need more people to finish daily tasks. For example, a company that reduces working days may need to find more young people to help finish its work. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that shorter working weeks can reduce the income of some workers. To be more specific, people who are paid by the hour may earn less money when they work fewer hours. For instance, some workers may find it difficult to pay for rent and food if their working hours are reduced. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that shorter working weeks have both advantages and disadvantages and should apply to workers of all ages."]},{"id":"we-33","number":33,"title":"Compulsory Foreign Languages","titleZh":"学校必修外语","prompt":"Some people think learning a foreign language at school should be compulsory. To what extent do you agree with it? Use your experience or examples to support your viewpoint.","stanceZh":"学校应该将外语列为必修课","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that learning a foreign language should be compulsory at school.","points":[{"id":"33.1","title":"所有学生获得平等学习机会","sentences":["making foreign languages compulsory can give all students equal chances to learn.","some students cannot afford private language classes, so schools can help them learn for free.","students from poor families can learn English at school even if their parents cannot pay for extra classes."],"groups":["access"]},{"id":"33.2","title":"外语带来更多工作机会","sentences":["learning foreign languages can provide more job opportunities for students.","many international companies need workers who can communicate with people from different countries.","students who can speak English may find jobs in international companies more easily after leaving school."],"groups":["jobs"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about compulsory foreign languages. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that learning a foreign language should be compulsory at school.","First of all, from my point of view, making foreign languages compulsory can give all students equal chances to learn. This means that some students cannot afford private language classes, so schools can help them learn for free. For example, students from poor families can learn English at school even if their parents cannot pay for extra classes. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that learning foreign languages can provide more job opportunities for students. To be more specific, many international companies need workers who can communicate with people from different countries. For instance, students who can speak English may find jobs in international companies more easily after leaving school. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that learning a foreign language should be compulsory at school."]},{"id":"we-34","number":34,"title":"Historic Buildings vs Modern Housing","titleZh":"历史建筑与现代住房","prompt":"Many countries spend large amounts of money on the restoration of historic buildings rather than on modern housing. To what extent do you agree or disagree with this analysis? What are advantages and disadvantages of this? Support your writing with your experience or examples.","stanceZh":"政府应该优先投资现代住房","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that governments should spend more money on modern housing rather than restoring historic buildings.","points":[{"id":"34.1","title":"修复旧建筑促进旅游业","sentences":["restoring historic buildings can help develop local tourism.","old buildings can attract more visitors and bring money to local businesses.","many tourists visit old cities to see historic buildings, and they spend money in local hotels, restaurants and shops."],"groups":["tourism"]},{"id":"34.2","title":"修复花费过多影响基础设施","sentences":["spending too much money on historic buildings can reduce funding for modern housing.","governments have limited money, so spending too much on old buildings may leave less money to improve infrastructure near people’s homes.","if a city spends too much money repairing historic buildings, it may not have enough money to improve roads and public transport in places where people live."],"groups":["budget"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about historic buildings vs modern housing. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that governments should spend more money on modern housing rather than restoring historic buildings.","First of all, from my point of view, restoring historic buildings can help develop local tourism. This means that old buildings can attract more visitors and bring money to local businesses. For example, many tourists visit old cities to see historic buildings, and they spend money in local hotels, restaurants and shops. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that spending too much money on historic buildings can reduce funding for modern housing. To be more specific, governments have limited money, so spending too much on old buildings may leave less money to improve infrastructure near people’s homes. For instance, if a city spends too much money repairing historic buildings, it may not have enough money to improve roads and public transport in places where people live. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that governments should spend more money on modern housing rather than restoring historic buildings."]},{"id":"we-35","number":35,"title":"Growing Up in the 21st Century","titleZh":"21世纪成长","prompt":"It is harder for children to grow up in the 21st century than it was in the past. How far do you agree with this statement? Give your opinions.","stanceZh":"现在的孩子成长比过去更难","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that growing up in the 21st century is harder than it was in the past.","points":[{"id":"35.1","title":"学生面临更大学习压力","sentences":["children today face more pressure from school than children in the past.","many students have a lot of homework and exams, so they have little time to rest and play.","some children attend extra classes on weekends instead of spending time playing with friends."],"groups":["mental-health"]},{"id":"35.2","title":"社交媒体影响学习与睡眠","sentences":["social media can create new problems for children today.","many children spend too much time watching short videos, which can affect their sleep and studies.","some students watch videos late at night, so they feel tired and cannot focus at school the next day."],"groups":["screen-risk"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about growing up in the 21st century. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that growing up in the 21st century is harder than it was in the past.","First of all, from my point of view, children today face more pressure from school than children in the past. This means that many students have a lot of homework and exams, so they have little time to rest and play. For example, some children attend extra classes on weekends instead of spending time playing with friends. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that social media can create new problems for children today. To be more specific, many children spend too much time watching short videos, which can affect their sleep and studies. For instance, some students watch videos late at night, so they feel tired and cannot focus at school the next day. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that growing up in the 21st century is harder than it was in the past."]},{"id":"we-36","number":36,"title":"City Life vs Countryside Life","titleZh":"城市与乡村生活","prompt":"Some people prefer to live in cities, while some people prefer to live in the countryside. Which is better for you? Give your reasons or experience.","stanceZh":"城市生活更适合我","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that living in cities is better for me.","points":[{"id":"36.1","title":"城市有更多工作机会","sentences":["cities can provide more job opportunities for people.","there are many international companies and large businesses in cities, so people can find jobs more easily.","after finishing university, I want to work in an international company, and living in a big city may give me more chances to find a good job."],"groups":["jobs"]},{"id":"36.2","title":"城市生活更方便","sentences":["living in cities is more convenient.","cities have better public transport systems, such as buses and trains, which can save people time and money.","people who cannot afford a car can still travel to work or school by bus or train."],"groups":["access","convenience"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about city life vs countryside life. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that living in cities is better for me.","First of all, from my point of view, cities can provide more job opportunities for people. This means that there are many international companies and large businesses in cities, so people can find jobs more easily. For example, after finishing university, I want to work in an international company, and living in a big city may give me more chances to find a good job. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that living in cities is more convenient. To be more specific, cities have better public transport systems, such as buses and trains, which can save people time and money. For instance, people who cannot afford a car can still travel to work or school by bus or train. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that living in cities is better for me."]},{"id":"we-37","number":37,"title":"AI Translation vs Foreign Language Learning","titleZh":"AI翻译与外语学习","prompt":"While artificial intelligence becomes so advanced, people can use computers to translate foreign languages. That makes learning a foreign language unnecessary. To what extent do you agree with it?","stanceZh":"即使有AI翻译学习外语仍必要","stance":"As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that learning foreign languages is still necessary even with AI translation.","points":[{"id":"37.1","title":"外语帮助找到更多工作","sentences":["learning foreign languages can provide more job opportunities for people.","many international companies need workers who can communicate with people from different countries.","students who can speak English can talk directly with foreign customers without using AI translation, which may help them find jobs more easily."],"groups":["jobs"]},{"id":"37.2","title":"AI翻译可能造成误解","sentences":["AI translation may cause problems in communication.","AI translation may make mistakes when translating some words or sentences, which can cause misunderstandings.","when people use AI to translate jokes or local expressions, the meaning may be wrong, so others may not understand them correctly."],"groups":["language"]}],"essay":["In recent years, there has been growing concern about ai translation vs foreign language learning. Some individuals believe that this issue brings important benefits, while others hold different views. As far as I am concerned, I am convinced that learning foreign languages is still necessary even with AI translation.","First of all, from my point of view, learning foreign languages can provide more job opportunities for people. This means that many international companies need workers who can communicate with people from different countries. For example, students who can speak English can talk directly with foreign customers without using AI translation, which may help them find jobs more easily. Hence, it is clear that this point is important when considering the issue.","Besides, I also hold another point of view that AI translation may cause problems in communication. To be more specific, AI translation may make mistakes when translating some words or sentences, which can cause misunderstandings. For instance, when people use AI to translate jokes or local expressions, the meaning may be wrong, so others may not understand them correctly. This undoubtedly shows why this issue deserves careful attention.","In conclusion, there is no denying that this topic plays an important role in modern society. Despite some opposing views, much evidence shows that learning foreign languages is still necessary even with AI translation."]}],"groups":[{"id":"jobs","title":"增加工作机会","description":"通过行业发展、语言能力或工作安排，解释就业机会如何增加。","pointIds":["13.1","32.1","33.2","36.1","37.1"]},{"id":"knowledge","title":"获取信息与学习新知","description":"围绕信息、学习资源和知识获取展开；保留各题具体渠道。","pointIds":["2.1","11.1","14.1","20.1","30.1"]},{"id":"misinformation","title":"错误信息影响判断","description":"信息未经核实传播，可能使人形成错误观点。","pointIds":["2.2","20.2"]},{"id":"personal-time","title":"工作挤占私人生活","description":"工作负担和长工时压缩休息与家庭时间。","pointIds":["3.1","8.2","22.2"]},{"id":"balance","title":"调整安排以实现平衡","description":"通过灵活安排或缩短工时，为休息、家庭或学习留出时间。","pointIds":["3.2","12.1","31.2"]},{"id":"family","title":"陪伴家人与家庭关系","description":"讨论相处时间如何影响家庭生活；正反方向按题目调整。","pointIds":["3.1","6.1","8.2","31.2"]},{"id":"health","title":"身体健康与充分休息","description":"讨论居住、医疗、工时或屏幕使用对健康的影响。","pointIds":["6.2","7.2","8.1","11.2","22.1"]},{"id":"mental-health","title":"心理健康与缓解压力","description":"围绕压力、休息、孤独感和心理状态展开。","pointIds":["8.1","14.2","15.2","22.1","35.1"]},{"id":"efficiency","title":"工作效率与时间成本","description":"解释环境、技术或决策方式如何改变完成任务所需的时间。","pointIds":["7.1","23.2","30.2","31.1"]},{"id":"practice","title":"实践培养实用技能","description":"真实场景中的练习，帮助培养沟通、合作或解决问题的能力。","pointIds":["12.2","17.2","24.1","24.2","26.1"]},{"id":"culture","title":"理解历史与文化","description":"通过戏剧或实地参观，了解过去的生活和文化。","pointIds":["10.2","17.1"]},{"id":"language","title":"语言理解与沟通障碍","description":"语言表达难懂或翻译不准，可能影响理解。","pointIds":["10.1","37.2"]},{"id":"access","title":"资源可及性与平等机会","description":"让无力承担额外费用的人也能获得学习或出行机会。","pointIds":["18.1","33.1","36.2"]},{"id":"fairness","title":"公平评估与合理回报","description":"围绕公平对待不同人展开，需使用该题的评估或报酬情境。","pointIds":["1.1","16.2"]},{"id":"time-management","title":"时间管理与守时习惯","description":"通过期限、任务或规划，培养更好的时间安排习惯。","pointIds":["5.1","5.2","12.1"]},{"id":"rules","title":"规则约束与责任意识","description":"教育、年龄要求或法律后果，帮助人们遵守规则、承担责任。","pointIds":["4.1","4.2","25.2","29.1"]},{"id":"climate-risk","title":"海平面上升与洪水风险","description":"洪水损害沿海住房或农田，居民可能被迫迁离。","pointIds":["9.1","27.1"]},{"id":"environment-policy","title":"环保政策与清洁能源","description":"通过政府资金、法规或清洁技术减少污染。","pointIds":["9.2","19.1","19.2","29.2"]},{"id":"pollution","title":"减少污染与环境损害","description":"从游客垃圾、交通方式或企业排放讨论环境后果。","pointIds":["13.2","18.2","19.2","29.2"]},{"id":"convenience","title":"生活便利与节省时间","description":"通过集中购物或公共交通，让日常活动更方便。","pointIds":["18.1","21.1","36.2"]},{"id":"income","title":"收入与利润减少","description":"收入或利润受损；企业和劳动者的具体机制应分别说明。","pointIds":["21.2","28.2","32.2"]},{"id":"screen-risk","title":"屏幕与社交媒体的负面影响","description":"长时间使用屏幕或社交媒体，影响健康、睡眠或学习。","pointIds":["11.2","25.1","35.2"]},{"id":"tourism","title":"旅游带动本地经济","description":"游客消费带动酒店、餐饮或商店发展。","pointIds":["13.1","34.1"]},{"id":"knowledge-check","title":"独立作答检查所学知识","description":"通过学生独立完成试题，判断知识掌握程度。","pointIds":["1.2"]},{"id":"privacy","title":"隐私权与个人安全","description":"名人的个人隐私同样值得保护。","pointIds":["15.1"]},{"id":"motivation","title":"工作动力与创新","description":"报酬激励影响努力工作、学习技能和创新的意愿。","pointIds":["16.1"]},{"id":"frontline","title":"一线经验改善产品与服务","description":"接触实际工作和顾客的员工能够提出实用建议。","pointIds":["23.1"]},{"id":"independence","title":"独立决策与应对新情况","description":"独立经历帮助人们安排生活和处理意外问题。","pointIds":["26.2"]},{"id":"research","title":"研究帮助风险应对","description":"研究结果帮助确定高风险地区并改善防护措施。","pointIds":["27.2"]},{"id":"trust","title":"品牌信誉与顾客信任","description":"可靠的产品与服务建立信任，带来回购和推荐。","pointIds":["28.1"]},{"id":"budget","title":"公共资金的优先分配","description":"预算有限时，过多修复支出可能挤占住房与基础设施资金。","pointIds":["34.2"]}]};
